(Admission Letter body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #111827; margin: 36px; line-height: 1.6; position: relative; } .watermark { position: fixed; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate\(-50%, -50%\) rotate\(-30deg\); font-size: 72px; font-weight: bold; color: rgba\(26, 60, 110, 0.08\); letter-spacing: 0.2em; z-index: 0; pointer-events: none; } .content { position: relative; z-index: 1; } .header { border-bottom: 3px solid #0000FF; padding-bottom: 14px; margin-bottom: 24px; } .brand-row { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; } .brand-block { background: linear-gradient\(135deg, #1a3c6e 0%, #0000FF 100%\); color: #ffffff; padding: 14px 18px; border-radius: 10px; min-width: 260px; } .brand-block .school-name { font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0; } .brand-block .school-subtitle { font-size: 11px; margin: 4px 0 0; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: 0.9; } .logo-box { width: 74px; height: 74px; border-radius: 12px; background: #fef3c7; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #0000FF; font-weight: bold; font-size: 20px; border: 2px solid #CCCC33; } .title { font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #1a3c6e; margin-bottom: 8px; } .subtitle { font-size: 12px; color: #4b5563; margin-bottom: 20px; } .letter-meta { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; font-size: 12px; color: #4b5563; margin-bottom: 20px; } .letter-meta .meta-block { min-width: 180px; } .meta { background: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid #CCCC33; padding: 12px 14px; margin: 18px 0 20px; } .meta p { margin: 4px 0; } .signature-box { margin-top: 48px; padding-top: 18px; border-top: 1px solid #d1d5db; width: 260px; } .signature-name { font-weight: bold; color: #1a3c6e; margin: 0 0 4px; } .signature-role { color: #6b7280; margin: 0; } JOOUST JOOUST Postgraduate Studies Office J Admission Letter Official confirmation of admission to the selected postgraduate programme Ref No: BPS/AF/2026/0002 Date: 04 August 2026 Dear stephen, This is to confirm your admission to Doctor of Philosophy in Health Informatics at JOOUST. Admission number: BPS/PHD/2026/001 Temporary password: 5bECkKU5ci Please log in and change your password immediately to activate your student portal account. We warmly welcome you to the JOOUST postgraduate community and look forward to your academic journey with us. Board of Postgraduate Studies \(BPS\) Joint Admission and Student Services Office This document is issued electronically and is valid as an official admission notice.) Tj
ET

